╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│▸ Usage:                                                                 │
│  otter enter my-box                                                     │
│  otter enter my-ubuntu --root                                           │
│  otter enter my-alpine -- sh -l                                         │
│  otter enter --name fedora-44 -- bash -l                                │
│  otter enter --additional-flags "--env MY_VAR=value" --n b1 -- bash -l  │
│  otter enter --additional-flags "--preserve-fds" --name test -- bash -l │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Options:                                                               │
│ --                        Command to execute into the container         │
│ --name             ┆ -n   Name of the container to enter                │
│ --root             ┆ -r   Launch container manager with root privileges │
│ --no-tty           ┆ -T   Do not instantiate a tty                      │
│ --clean-path              Reset PATH inside container to FHS standard   │
│ --no-workdir       ┆ -nw  Always start from container's home directory  │
│ --additional-flags ┆ -a   Additional flags to pass to container manager │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Extras:                                                                │
│ --help    ┆ -h  Show this help message                                  │
│ --verbose ┆ -v  Show more verbose output                                │
│ --dry-run ┆ -d   Print the generated container manager command          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Notes:                                                                 │
│ --root  Preferred over 'sudo otter' when root is needed. To use a       │
│         program other than sudo, set OTR_SUDO_PROGRAM or the            │
│         'otter_sudo_program' config variable.                           │
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
